E XML input to take precedence when available. For single-line image input, or when no text direction is present in the XML input, select `Left-to-right` or `Right-to-left` as appropriate for the OCR model and text.", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": false, "optional": false, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": "auto", "options": [["Auto", "auto", true], ["Left-to-right", "L", false], ["Right-to-left", "R", false]], "display": null, "multiple": false, "textable": false}]}, {"model_class": "ConditionalWhen", "value": "--no-reorder", "inputs": []}], "test_param": {"model_class": "SelectToolParameter", "name": "mode", "argument": null, "type": "select", "label": "Output text in logical order using the Unicode BiDi algorithm", "help": "Choose whether Kraken should apply the Unicode bidirectional (BiDi) text algorithm to produce OCR output in logical text order. This is mainly relevant for right-to-left text, or mixed left-to-right and right-to-left text.", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": true, "optional": false, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": "--reorder", "options": [["Yes", "--reorder", true], ["No", "--no-reorder", false]], "display": null, "multiple": false, "textable": false}}, {"model_class": "SelectToolParameter", "name": "text_direction", "argument": "--text-direction", "type": "select", "label": "OCR text direction", "help": "Select `Horizontal, top-to-bottom` for horizontal text lines such as English, German, Greek, Arabic, or Hebrew; `Vertical, left-to-right` for vertical text with columns ordered left-to-right; or `Vertical, right-to-left` for vertical text with columns ordered right-to-left, such as traditional Chinese, Japanese, or Korean layouts.", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": false, "optional": false, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": "horizontal-tb", "options": [["Horizontal, top-to-bottom", "horizontal-tb", true], ["Vertical, left-to-right", "vertical-lr", false], ["Vertical, 